# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 (a host's child document is a dynamic of the child's elements) and ch. 7, "Structural dynamics" (round 3 ST): `$doc` is structural, so its update event fires at n+1 with the document after n, owing that tick, where today's rule fired it at n.
test the_document_updates_in_its_tick

